{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18654","headline":"登蒲州石矶望横江口潭岛深逈斜对香零山 · 柳宗元","name":"登蒲州石矶望横江口潭岛深逈斜对香零山","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"隐忧倦永夜，凌雾临江津。\n猿鸣稍已疎，登石娱清沦。\n日出洲渚静，澄明皛无垠。\n浮晖翻高禽，沈景照文鳞。\n双江汇西奔，诡怪潜坤珍。\n孤山乃北峙，森爽栖灵神。\n洄潭或动容，岛屿疑摇振。\n陶埴兹择土，蒲鱼相与邻。\n信美非所安，羁心屡逡巡。\n糺结良可解，纡郁亦已伸。\n高歌返故室，自誷非所欣。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"柳宗元","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_18654.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18654","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}